- Frequency of reading books is in [Less than once a year, Rarely]
- Reason for reading books is in [Entertainment Purpose, To increase my English vocabulary knowledge]
- Amount of time spent reading books per day < 0.5
- Number of e-books you read last two years is in [1-5, nan]
- Number of printed books you read last two years is in [1-5, nan]
- Favorite books for reading to spend leisure time is in [Fiction, Politics, Others]
- What is the change that you felt after reading books is in [Feel Relax, Increase Motivation, Others]
- Department is in [BBA, JMC, Textile, NFE, Others]
- Frequency of reading books is in [Less than once a year]
- How to manage books for reading is in [Others, Borrow]

10 different conditions for class "1" (Reads academic books most of the time):

- Reason for reading books is Academic Purpose
- Amount of time spent reading books per day >= 1
- Frequency of reading books is in [On everyday basis, Often]
- Number of e-books you read last two years is in [11-15, 16-20, More than 20]
- Number of printed books you read last two years is in [11-15, 16-20, More than 20]
- What is the change that you felt after reading books is Increase Academic Performance
